  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking how to get somewhere",
     "texto": [
      "**Как пройти к вокзалу?** asks how to get to the station on foot. After **к** the dative is used: **к вокзалу**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Direction and location",
     "texto": [
      "**Направо** shows that you have to move to the right; **справа** places something on the right: **Поверните направо. Вокзал справа.** **Через дорогу** means «across the street»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Route expressions",
     "texto": [
      "**По улице** shows the way you follow (по + dative); **до светофора**, the point you reach (до + genitive); **рядом с банком**, a nearby place (рядом с + instrumental)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
